    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d6-a13">

                <pb facs="0142" n="14" xml:id="pg14"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 13 in No. 53.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Count Szögyényi to Mr. Francis</hi>.</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Vienna</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1885-01-14"><hi rendition="#italic">January</hi> 14,
                        1885</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I beg to inform you that, according to a
                    communication I have just received from the imperial royal ministry of war, the
                    order given on Friday last to liberate, on furlough, L. Feinknopf, has been, as
                    I was convinced from the beginning, <hi rendition="#italic">immediately</hi>
                    executed by the military authorities at Krakau.</p>
                <p>I have, &amp;c.,</p>
                <closer><signed>SZÖGYÉNYI.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
